# Local-chain deployment artifacts are ephemeral + deployer-specific — regenerate with
# `npm run deploy:local`. Only real-network deployments (Amoy/mainnet/…) are committed.
packages/sdk/src/deployments/31337.json
packages/sdk/src/deployments/1337.json

# Generated SDK code — regenerated from the contracts + committed deployment JSON via `npm run generate`
